`uncheckedGet` is a `nish:unsafe` function and is called only through an import of it, so that each module that gives up a check or defines a wrap says so at its top: add `import { uncheckedGet } from "nish:unsafe"`
`wrappingAdd` is a `nish:unsafe` function and is called only through an import of it, so that each module that gives up a check or defines a wrap says so at its top: add `import { wrappingAdd } from "nish:unsafe"`
